 moms' side relaxed and easy to wear.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Shirt polish:</strong> Collared short-sleeve shirts add a neat finish for boys and dads without feeling stiff.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready comfort:</strong> Lightweight woven cotton keeps the full family look breathable for warm-weather plans.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each role and size you need, and build a family matching look that feels calm, polished, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Animal Print","Beach","Boy Shirt","Brown","Cap Sleeve Dress","Child 1-2 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Collared Shirt","Daddy and Me","Dress & Shirt","Earth Tone","Elephant Print","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father L","Father M","Father S","Father Shirt","Father XL","Four-Role Matching","Giraffe Print","Girl Dress","Gray","Green","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1035252493819.html","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Matching Family Shirt","Mommy and Me","Mother Dress","Mother L","Mother M","Mother S","Multicolor","Olive","Resort","Safari","Safari Caravan","Sets","Short Sleeve Shirt","Summer","Summer Family Matching Set","Tie Waist","Vacation"],"seo":{"title":"Safari Caravan Family Matching Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Lightweight cotton family matching set with safari-print dresses and shirts for mom, dad, girls & boys. Sizes 1-2Y through 10Y, Mother S-L, Father S-3XL."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-11","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Outfit Sets"},"options":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9617064394849","name":"Type","position":1,"values":["Dress","Shirt"],"optionValues":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6138414006369","name":"Dress","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6138413351009","name":"Shirt","hasVariants":true}]},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9617064427617","na